  "content": "\n\n<p>適用於<span style=\"color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/soviet-flans-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Flan's mod</a></span>&nbsp;的內容包，為您的遊戲加入逼真的美系特斯拉車輛。所有模型皆十分精緻。<br><br><strong>現有車輛清單：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tesla Cybertruck</li>\n<li>Tesla Model X</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>很遺憾，目前您需要安裝 Extended Flan's mod 而非原版 Flan's mod，不過它同樣支援標準內容包。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>官方 VK 社團：</strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvk.com%252fnewvistudio\" rel=\"nofollow\">vk.com/newvistudio</a></span><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvk.com%252fiwantonion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a>Discord 頻道：</strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://discord.gg/6PCAWz7\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord.gg/6PCAWz7</a></span><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NWw3Vnz/2020-04-03-11-21-16.png\" alt=\"2020-04-03-11-21-16\"></p>",
